# Compiled MEX gateway (built by the Makefile / CMake glue). The mwrap-
# generated sources (baobzi_mex_gen.cpp, bz_*.m) are *committed* — they are
# generated-not-hand-edited and only regenerated when baobzi.mw changes.
# Julia libraries don't commit their resolved Manifest, nor the deps.jl that
# Pkg.build("Baobzi") writes (deps/build.jl regenerates it).
